# The themes inspired by the 16-bit console: controle, lavanda, cartucho, modo7.
Output docs/images/themes-retro.gif
Set Height 760
Source docs/demo/settings.tape

Hide
Type "/tmp/qt-seed /tmp/qt-vhs full controle >/dev/null; clear; ./quest" Enter
Sleep 4.4s
Show

Sleep 1.8s
Type "t"
Sleep 500ms
Down
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 1.8s
Type "t"
Sleep 500ms
Down
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 1.8s
Type "t"
Sleep 500ms
Down
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 2s
